1.grep <pattern> <file...> => Search for pattern in file(s)
2.grep -r <pattern> <dir> => Search for pattern recursively in a
directory
3.grep -i <pattern> <file> => Search for pattern case-
insensitively
4.grep -v <pattern> <file> => Search for lines not matching
pattern
5.grep -n <pattern> <file> => Search and print line numbers
6.find <dir> -name <name>* => Find files in <dir> with name
starting with <name>
7.find <dir> -type <type>  => Find files in <dir> of type
<type>

